OL,3,GNEWSARobbie Butler announced as new
OL,4,Ahealth minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FLagan Valley Ulster Unionist assembly
OL,7,Fmember (MLA) Robbie Butler has been
OL,8,Fannounced as the new health minister.
OL,10,FHis appointment comes after Mike
OL,11,FNesbitt resigned as health minister
OL,12,Fafter his party leader Jon Burrows told
OL,13,Fa town hall meeting that he did not
OL,14,Fsupport emergency general surgery (EGS)
OL,15,Fbeing removed from Causeway Hospital.
OL,17,FOn Monday, Burrows said he was
OL,18,Fdisappointed by Nesbitt's decision to
OL,19,Fquit and said he would decide
OL,20,F"overnight" who would replace him.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
