OL,3,GNEWSARobbie Butler announced as new
OL,4,Ahealth minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FButler is a former UUP deputy leader
OL,7,Fand has twice considered running for
OL,8,Fleadership, only to withdraw at the
OL,9,Flast moment.
